    "text": "The R.M.S. speeds of the molecules of Hydrogen, Oxygen, and Carbon dioxide&nbsp;at the same temperature are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub></math> respectively, then:",
