  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula of root-mean-square speed in terms of absolute temperature and molecular mass of the gas&nbsp;is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>M</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math>, here we know that,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>M</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub></math>.</p>",
